#: ../../../syntax-easy.rst:32
msgid ""
"``//`` is floor division on two ints, so it discards the remainder and "
"returns the integer ``3``. Only ``/`` (true division) would give a float."
msgstr ""
"``//`` es la división entera de dos enteros, así que descarta el resto y "
"devuelve el entero ``3``. Solo ``/`` (división real) daría un flotante."

