#: ../../../syntax-easy.rst:82
msgid ""
"``**`` is the exponentiation operator, so ``2 ** 3`` means two to the power "
"of three, which is ``8`` (not ``2 * 3``)."
msgstr ""
"``**`` es el operador de exponenciación, así que ``2 ** 3`` significa dos "
"elevado a tres, que es ``8`` (no ``2 * 3``)."

#: ../../../syntax-easy.rst:99
